<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Sept trade gap widens to SKK 37.17 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Sept trade gap widens to SKK 37.17 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's trade deficit for the first nine months of the year widened to 37.17 billion crowns from 35.31 billion crowns for the January-August period, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
